<script setup lang="ts">
/** 框架请假单示例页，仅用于查看 Warm-Flow 示例联动，不作为织云正式人事单据。 / Framework leave demo, not an ERP HR transaction. */
import { onMounted, reactive, ref } from 'vue'
import message from 'ant-design-vue/es/message'
import Modal from 'ant-design-vue/es/modal'
import api from '../api'
import { can } from '../utils/perms'
import StandardListLayout from '../components/StandardListLayout.vue'
import FoundationTable from '../components/FoundationTable.vue'

const rows=ref<any[]>([]),loading=ref(false),page=ref(1),size=ref(20),total=ref(0),opened=ref(false),saving=ref(false),submitFlow=ref(false)
const form=reactive<any>({id:undefined,applyCode:'',leaveType:'',startDate:undefined,endDate:undefined,leaveDays:1,remark:''})
const columns=[{key:'applyCode',title:'申请编号',width:170},{key:'leaveType',title:'请假类型',width:140},{key:'startDate',title:'开始时间',width:180},{key:'endDate',title:'结束时间',width:180},{key:'leaveDays',title:'天数',width:90},{key:'statusName',title:'审批状态',width:120},{key:'remark',title:'请假原因',width:240}]
async function load(){loading.value=true;try{const r:any=await api.get('/workflow/leave/list',{params:{pageNum:page.value,pageSize:size.value}});if(r.code!==200)throw new Error(r.msg||'查询失败');rows.value=(r.data?.rows||[]).map((x:any)=>({...x,id:String(x.id),statusName:x.status||'草稿'}));total.value=Number(r.data?.total||0)}catch(e:any){message.error(e?.response?.data?.msg||e.message||'加载失败')}finally{loading.value=false}}
function edit(row?:any){Object.assign(form,{id:undefined,applyCode:'',leaveType:'',startDate:undefined,endDate:undefined,leaveDays:1,remark:''});if(row)Object.assign(form,row,{id:String(row.id)});submitFlow.value=false;opened.value=true}
function prepareSubmit(){if(!form.leaveType||!form.startDate||!form.endDate)return message.warning('请填写请假类型和起止时间');submitFlow.value=true;Modal.confirm({title:'提交框架请假示例',content:'提交后将通过框架请假示例流程发起审批。请确认你是在检查框架演示，不是在录入正式 ERP 人事数据。',okText:'继续提交',cancelText:'取消',async onOk(){await save(true)}})}
async function save(submit=false){saving.value=true;try{const body={...form,startDate:form.startDate?.format?.('YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm:ss'),endDate:form.endDate?.format?.('YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm:ss'),id:form.id||undefined};const url=submit?'/workflow/leave/submitAndFlowStart':form.id?'/workflow/leave':'/workflow/leave';const r:any=form.id&&!submit?await api.put(url,body):await api.post(url,body);if(r.code!==200)throw new Error(r.msg||'保存失败');opened.value=false;message.success(submit?'示例请假申请已提交':'已保存');await load()}catch(e:any){message.error(e?.response?.data?.msg||e.message||'操作失败')}finally{saving.value=false}}
function remove(row:any){Modal.confirm({title:'删除示例申请',content:`确认删除申请“${row.applyCode||row.id}”吗？`,okText:'删除',cancelText:'取消',okType:'danger',async onOk(){const r:any=await api.delete('/workflow/leave/'+row.id);if(r.code!==200)throw new Error(r.msg||'删除失败');await load()}})}
onMounted(load)
</script>
<template><StandardListLayout><template #filters><a-alert type="warning" show-icon message="此页面是框架随附的请假流程演示，只用于检查流程引擎联动，不属于织云 ERP 正式人事功能。" /></template><FoundationTable page-toolbar storage-key="workflow_leave_demo" :columns="columns" :rows="rows" :loading="loading" :server-total="total" :server-page="page" :server-page-size="size" :action-width="150" @page-change="(p,s)=>{page=p;size=s;load()}"><template #actions><a-button v-if="can('workflow:leave:add')" type="primary" @click="edit()">新增示例申请</a-button><a-button @click="page=1;load()">查询</a-button></template><template #cell="{column,row}"><a-tag v-if="column.key==='statusName'" color="blue">{{row.statusName}}</a-tag><span v-else>{{row[column.key]||'—'}}</span></template><template #action="{row}"><a-button v-if="can('workflow:leave:edit')" type="link" size="small" @click="edit(row)">编辑</a-button><a-button v-if="can('workflow:leave:remove')" type="link" danger size="small" @click="remove(row)">删除</a-button></template></FoundationTable></StandardListLayout><a-modal :open="opened" title="框架请假示例" :confirm-loading="saving" :mask-closable="false" :keyboard="false" ok-text="保存草稿" cancel-text="取消" @ok="save(false)" @cancel="opened=false"><a-form layout="vertical"><div class="form-grid"><a-form-item label="请假类型" required><a-select v-model:value="form.leaveType" :options="['年假','事假','病假','调休'].map(x=>({value:x,label:x}))" /></a-form-item><a-form-item label="请假天数"><a-input-number v-model:value="form.leaveDays" :min="1" :precision="0" style="width:100%" /></a-form-item><a-form-item label="开始时间" required><a-date-picker v-model:value="form.startDate" show-time style="width:100%" /></a-form-item><a-form-item label="结束时间" required><a-date-picker v-model:value="form.endDate" show-time style="width:100%" /></a-form-item><a-form-item label="请假原因" class="full"><a-textarea v-model:value="form.remark" :rows="3" /></a-form-item></div><a-button v-if="can('workflow:leave:add')&&!form.id" type="primary" ghost :loading="saving" @click="prepareSubmit">保存并提交示例审批</a-button></a-form></a-modal></template>
<style scoped>.form-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 16px}.full{grid-column:1/-1}</style>
